    <!-- Help -->
    <string name="help_title">Car Browser</string>
    <string name="help_text">Version %1$s\n\n• Type in the top bar to search or open a website.\n• Menu → Desktop site shows the full computer version of a site (nice on wide screens).\n• Menu → Text size makes pages easier to read.\n• The grid button opens every app on this screen, including ones the car hides, plus shortcuts into Android settings.\n• If a heavy site (like YouTube) doesn\'t work here, tap \"Get Firefox\" on the home page. It installs a separate browser with a newer engine.\n\nOnly use the browser while parked.</string>
